2 CONT ====Allahumma Salle 'ala Syedina Muhammadin wa 'ala Aalihi Syedina Muhammadin Wa Barik Wa Sallim
2 CONT
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Fatima Zahra (fātima, فاطمة1; zahra ou az-zahraʾa, الزهراء, la resplendissante), est la fille du prophète de l'islam Mahomet et de sa première femme Khadija, née à La Mecque vers 606 et morte à Médine le 28 août 632 (3 joumada ath
2 CONC -thania 11 AH).
2 CONT http://bit.ly/1MhJnFH
2 CONT
2 CONT Shia scholars view is that Fatimah was Muhammad's only biological daughter and the only one who married a Khalifah, i.e., Ali. They argue it improbable for Khadija to have given birth to so many children at such an advanced age, w
2 CONC hile at the same time having abstained from having children in both her previous marriages. A third version also exists which views the two daughters as being the children of Khadijah's deceased sister. http://bit.ly/1WLCS2N
2 CONT
2 CONT List of Fatima's names http://bit.ly/1QdAtio
2 CONT --------------------
