2 CONT * Wafaat (Death): 49 AH (669 AD)
2 CONT --------------------
2 CONT Grandson of the Prophet Muhammad, PBUH, through his daughter Bibi Fatima Zahra.
2 CONT
2 CONT Him and his brother, Hussain, were greatly beloved to the Prophet Muhammad PBUH. 
2 CONT
