2 CONT     (Arabic for Father of Freedom)
2 CONT
2 CONT Birth 	3rd[1] or 5th[4] Sha'aban 4 AH[1][4] ≈ Jan. 8, 626 C.E. Death 	10th Muharram 61 AH[1] ≈ Oct. 10, 680 C.E. Birthplace 	Medina[1] Buried 	Imam Husayn Shrine, Karbala Life Duration
2 CONT
2 CONT Before Imamate: 46 years (4 - 50 AH) - 7 years with his grandfather Muhammad - 7 years with his mother Fatimah - 36 years with his father Ali - 46 years with his brother Hasan ibn Ali Imāmate: 11 years (50 - 61 AH) Titles
