2 CONT Grandson of the Prophet Muhammad, PBUH, through his daughter Bibi Fatima Zahra.
2 CONT
2 CONT There are many ways to spell his Anglicized name: Husein, Hussein, Hussain, Husain, Hussayn, Husayn, etc. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Killed in the Battle of Karbala on his way to Kufa in modern Iraq. 
