1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Yahya married his cousin, Mahba bint Amr ibn Ali ibn al-Husayn (AS). [29] Most historians and genealogists have not mentioned a son for Yahya; Rather, it is said that he died at a young age; But Hamdallah Mostofi c
2 CONC onsidered a person named Abdullah Ibn Yahya as one of his children who was known as Talib al-Haqq. [30] Ibn Jibar also mentioned a girl named Zainab bint Yahya Ibn Zayd Ibn Imam Sajjad (AS). The shrine of Zainab bint Yahya is know
2 CONC n in Egypt. [32]
2 CONT
