1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Hassan al-Aftas avait 5 fils: Abdollah Shahid, Ali, Omar, Hossein et Hossein Makhfouf. Abdollah Shahid fut execute par Harun al-Rashid, quant a Hossein Makhfoof, il est l'ancetre de la dynastie de Hezaveh de Faraha
2 CONC n a laquelle appartient Abolghassem Ghaem Magham, et Ali al-Jerzy est le pere de Shahzadeh (prince) Mohammad lequel est enterre a Fam, Tafresh et la magnifique cour de la mosquee qui lui fut dediee fut construite par Khajeh Mu'umi
2 CONC n (+1170 Hegire), le frere de Amin al-Din bin Mohammad Hossein al-Hosseini pendant le regne de Shah Abbas II.
2 CONT
2 CONT حسن افطس پنج پسر داشته: عبدالله شهید، علی، عمر، حسین و حسین مکفوف. عبدالله شهید به دست هارون الرشید مقتول شده؛ و حسین مکفوف جد سادات هزاوة فراهان است که مرحوم میرزا ابوالقاسم قائم مقام از آنهاست؛ و علی الجرزی والد شاهزاده محمد است
2 CONC  که در فم تفرش مدفون گردیده و قبه و صحن مجلل او را خواجه مؤمن (فوت 1170 هجری) برادر امین الدین (امینا) بن محمد حسین الحسینی در زمان شاه عباس دوم بنا نموده اس
2 CONT
2 CONT 33eme generation
2 CONT ================
2 CONT Allameh Qutb Ravandi
2 CONT
2 CONT In 573 AH, Allameh    Qutbuddin Ravandi,   one of the brilliant figures of the Shiite world, passed away. Ravandi, a great   sixth-century scientist, has also trained   prominent students, including ...  Ali ibn   Muhammad al -Ma'
2 CONC idani,  
2 CONT
2 CONT Muhammad ibn Hassan Efts ibn Ali Asghar ibn Imam Zayn al-Abidine (AS) who reaches Imam Sajjad (AS) with four intermediaries and is the ancestor of the Supreme Leader.
2 CONT [...  This Imam is at the head of the Sadat Hussein dynasty. Prophet Sultan Muhammad is the father of Sultan Sayyid Ahmad, who is buried in Hazawa, and this nobleman, with four intermediaries, reaches to Imam Sajjad (AS) whose tom
2 CONC b is in honor of Sayyid Muhammad, Mashhad. Here are the testimonies of Sultan Muhammad Abed Mashhad Miqhan that we just visited on the way to Arak.
2 CONT
2 CONT The Sadat Hussein dynasty is a continuous succession to the late Sayyid Qutb al-Din, after Qutb al-Din https://www.geni.com/people/601-Seid-Ghotbeddin-Tafreshi-patriarche-de-la-branche-Mir-Fakhrayee/6000000037193211684?through=600
2 CONC 0000049379572971  there are two strings. One field is that of Sayyid Zahiruddin and Sayyid Fakhruddin, known as Mir Fakhra, who is (the Supreme Leader)'s dynasty. Sayyid Fakhruddin is one of (the Supreme Leader)'s ancestors who ar
2 CONC e descendants of Qutbuddin.
2 CONT
2 CONT Another dynasty Another branch of the descendants of Sayyid Qutb al-Din https://www.geni.com/people/601-Seid-Ghotbeddin-Tafreshi-patriarche-de-la-branche-Mir-Fakhrayee/6000000037193211684  is the family of the deputy of Farahani w
2 CONC ho were also great ones to reach Mirza Isa https://www.geni.com/people/Mirza-BOZORG-Issa-Farahani-GHAEM-MAGHAM-1/6000000036440094853  and later Mirza Abulqasim https://www.geni.com/people/Mirza-Abol-Ghassem-Farahani-GHAEM-MAGHAM-2
2 CONC /6000000036834695186?through=6000000036440094853 the deputy of Farahani who are also from the same Sadat Hussein dynasty from Qutbuddin , Our (the Supreme Leader's) dynasty Sadat al-Tafrish and Ashtian region and so on, they are s
2 CONC eparated from their dynasty, these were mostly people of science and religion, they were mostly political men.
2 CONT
2 CONT Sayed Fakhruddin, known as Mir Fakhra, is the grandson of the late Sayyid Fakhruddin, son of Sayyid Mohammad Taghi, a young man named Sayyid Mohammad. He rises from Tafresh. He goes to Azerbaijan, where this dynasty becomes Khamen
2 CONC ei. Sayyid Muhammad, who had gone from Tafresh to Khamenei and had settled there, holds that Sayyid Tafreshi in the city of Khamenei and his grandfather is Sayed Muhammad's grandson. They go from Tabriz to Mashhad. We have now ret
2 CONC urned from Mashhad to Tafresh. During all the imposed war and from the beginning of the Islamic Republic up to the present day we have not seen anything but goodness, goodness and good opinion. »
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT ----
2 CONT
