1 NAME Ahmad al-Haddad /Al-Ba'lawi/
2 GIVN Ahmad al-Haddad
2 SURN Al-Ba'lawi
2 _MARNM Al-Ba'lawi
1 NAME Ahmad al-Haddad
1 SEX M
