1 NAME Sheikh Safi-ad-din Esh'hagh Ardabili - Grand Master's Zahediyeh Sufi Order /Abul Fath Ardabili - Founder of the Saffaviyya Sufi order (27)/
2 GIVN Sheikh Safi-ad-din Esh'hagh Ardabili - Grand Master's Zahediyeh Sufi Order
2 _MARNM Abul Fath Ardabili - Founder of the Saffaviyya Sufi order (27)
1 NAME شیخ صفی‌الدین ابوالفتح اسحاق اردبیلی
2 GIVN شیخ صفی‌الدین ابوالفتح اسحاق اردبیلی
2 SURN
1 SEX M
